# The shared lines, Phase 8 session 2 (Docs/Design/84 §33.1, §33.3): help offered and taken (offer, accept, refuse), a
# request granted (grant), advice (give.advice) and a view (give.opinion), with the agreement a view is mostly met
# with (agree), so a view isn't answered by another view more often than by a nod. Move lines (no concept).
#
# A view here is on the everyday run of things, never on one of the realm's issues (once one is aired, the engine leaves
# an everyday view unsaid: Phase 6's stance lines say those, true to each speaker's side), and never a claim: an opinion of the subject of gossip is of the deed, not
# the wolf. Advice is true wherever it's said (no "the chapel feeds folk" where it may not). An offer is of help, a
# hand or company, which a talk can give; a refusal is softened and explained (§7.2).

## offer: help, after a worry or a grumble

rule s8o_offer_any
does offer
weight 0.6
say #helpout#? | Can I do anything? | Do you want a hand with it? | Is there aught I can do? | You've only to ask, you know.

rule s8o_offer_work
does offer
when conv.topic=work|day
weight 0.6
say Need a paw with it after hours? | I could lend a hand at the end of the day. | Want me to ask about, for anything going?

rule s8o_offer_home
does offer
when conv.topic=home|family
weight 0.6
say I could come round and help, if you like. | Shall I look in on you tomorrow? | Do you want company tonight?

rule s8o_offer_health
does offer
when conv.topic=health
weight 0.6
tone tender
say Shall I fetch the healer to you? | Do you want me to sit with you a while? | I could bring you some broth.

rule s8o_offer_money
does offer
when conv.topic=prices|times|food self.wealth=comfortable|rich self.homeless=no
weight 0.5
say I could spare a few pennies, if it'd help. | Come and eat at mine, if it's lean. | I've a loaf more than I need. Want it?

rule s8o_offer_road
does offer
when conv.topic=bandits|travel|caravan
weight 0.6
say I'll walk with you as far as the gate. | Do you want company on the road? | Wait, and we'll go together.

rule s8o_offer_crime
does offer
when conv.topic=crime|gossip topic.claim_kind=theft|violence|prowling other.homeless=no
weight 0.6
say Shall I walk you home after dark? | Do you want me to look in on your place? | I'll keep an eye on your door, if you like.

## accept and refuse: the answers to an offer

rule s8o_accept_any
does accept
say That's kind. Yes, please. | I'd not say no. | If you're sure. | Thank you. I'd like that. | #bc_go_on_then# | Would you? That'd help.

rule s8o_accept_any2
does accept
say You're a good one. Yes. | I won't pretend I don't need it. | Aye. Thank you. | That's a weight off. Yes.

rule s8o_refuse_any
does refuse
weight 0.5
say #hedge#, but I'll manage. You're kind to offer. | That's good of you, but no. I'd sooner see to it myself. | Thank you, but I'll be all right. Truly. | No, no. Keep it for yourself. I'll get by.

rule s8o_refuse_proud
does refuse
when self.wealth=poor|destitute
weight 0.5
say I'll not take charity, thank you all the same. | I can't take it. I'd never pay it back. I'll manage. | That's kind, but I've my pride, little as it is.

## grant: yes to a request

rule s8o_grant_any
does grant
say #s8_sure# | #s8_sure# | Leave it with me. | I can do that. | Consider it done. | #bc_gladly#

rule s8o_grant_any2
does grant
say Aye, I'll see to it. | No trouble at all. | Happy to help. | For you, aye.

rule s8o_grant_work
does grant
when conv.topic=work|day
say I'll ask at work for you. | I'll see what I can do there. | I'll put a word in, aye.

rule s8o_grant_pastimes
does grant
when conv.topic=pastimes|friends|animals
say Aye, I'll show you how. | Come by and I'll teach you. | Course. It's easy, once you've the knack.

## give.advice: what one would do

rule s8o_advice_any
does give.advice
when topic.claim_kind!=death|victim|violence
weight 0.6
say #advise#, I'd not fret over it. | Give it time. | Look after yourself first. | One step at a time. | Don't let it get on top of you.

rule s8o_advice_any2
does give.advice
weight 0.6
say Talk it over with someone. | Take it a day at a time. | Don't let it eat at you. | Ask someone who knows.

rule s8o_advice_hungry
does give.advice
when other.hungry=yes
say Get something warm in you, first. | Eat, before anything else. | Find a meal. The rest can wait. | You'll think straighter with something in your belly.

rule s8o_advice_health
does give.advice
when conv.topic=health
tone tender
say See the healer, and don't put it off. | Rest, and plenty of broth. | #advise#, try #remedy#. | Keep warm and keep still. | Don't go back to work too soon.

rule s8o_advice_food
does give.advice
when conv.topic=food
say Eat something warm, at least. | Little and often, when it's lean. | Don't skip your supper for anyone. | Bread and broth go further than you'd think.

rule s8o_advice_money
does give.advice
when conv.topic=prices|price_cause|times
say Buy what you need and no more. | Keep a little back, when you can. | Shop around. Someone's always cheaper. | Don't pay the first price asked.

rule s8o_advice_road
does give.advice
when conv.topic=bandits|caravan|travel
tone serious
say Travel by day, and go in company. | Keep off the road a while, if you can. | Wait for a caravan and walk with it. | Don't carry more than you can lose.

rule s8o_advice_crime
does give.advice
when conv.topic=crime|gossip topic.claim_kind=theft|violence|prowling|wanted
tone serious
say Bar your door at night. | Keep your purse close and your wits closer. | Tell the Watch, for what it's worth. | Don't walk the back ways after dark.

rule s8o_advice_weather_cold
does give.advice
when conv.topic=weather|season here.season=autumn|winter
say Wrap up warm. | Keep your feet dry. | Get a fire going early. | Don't go out with a wet coat.

rule s8o_advice_weather_warm
does give.advice
when conv.topic=weather|season here.season=spring|summer
say Keep to the shade at noon. | Drink plenty. | Work early and rest late. | Mind the sun on your nose.

rule s8o_advice_work
does give.advice
when conv.topic=work|day
say Keep your head down and your paws busy. | Ask for more. The worst they'll say is no. | Don't let them work you to the bone. | Learn all you can. It's yours to keep.

rule s8o_advice_family
does give.advice
when conv.topic=family|home
say Give it time. Families mend. | Say your piece, then let it lie. | Talk to them, before it festers. | Keep the peace at home. It's worth more than being right.

rule s8o_advice_friends
does give.advice
when conv.topic=friends|quarrel
say Make it up. Life's short. | A friend's worth a bit of pride. | Let it go. You'll both feel better.

rule s8o_advice_faith
does give.advice
when conv.topic=faith|dreams
say Light a candle. It can't hurt. | Ask the priest. That's what priests are for. | Say a word to the Bright One, and sleep on it.

rule s8o_advice_dreams
does give.advice
when conv.topic=dreams
weight 0.5
say Don't eat cheese before bed. | Sleep on your other side. | Don't go looking for meanings.

rule s8o_advice_plan
does give.advice
when conv.move=tell.plan|answer.plan
say Mind you think it through. | Start early, while you're fresh. | Don't tell too many till it's done. | Do it properly or not at all.

rule s8o_advice_pastimes
does give.advice
when conv.topic=pastimes|animals|land
say Patience. It comes with patience. | Little and often, that's the way. | Don't rush it, and it'll come.

rule s8o_advice_young
does give.advice
when other.stage=young|adolescent self.stage=adult|old
say Listen to your elders, now. | Mind you're home before dark. | Do as you're told, and you'll not go wrong. | Don't go far.

## give.opinion: a view on the everyday run of things

rule s8o_view_any
does give.opinion
when topic.claim_kind!=death|victim|violence
weight 0.6
say It'll come right in the end. | That's how things are, these days. | Can't say it surprises me. | It's not how it was. | There's worse things.

rule s8o_view_crime
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=gossip|crime topic.claim_kind=theft|violence|wanted|prowling
weight 0.5
say There's too much of that about. | The Watch should look sharper. | Folk aren't what they were. | You can't leave a thing out these days.

rule s8o_view_death
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=gossip|life|news topic.claim_kind=death
weight 0.5
tone grave
say Hard on those left behind. | We never know the day, do we. | It makes you hold your own closer.

rule s8o_view_marriage
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=gossip|life|news topic.claim_kind=marriage
weight 0.5
tone light
say They'll do well together, I'd think. | Good. Every town needs a wedding. | That's a match, that is.

rule s8o_view_newcomer
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=newcomer|gossip topic.claim_kind=newcomer
weight 0.5
say New faces do a town good. | Time will tell with #topic.them#. | We'll see what #topic.they# makes of us.

rule s8o_view_prices_up
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=prices|price_cause topic.dir=up
weight 0.6
say Somebody's doing well out of it. | It'll be the poor that feel it. | They'll go up again, mark me. | It's always the same goods that go dear.

rule s8o_view_prices_road
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=prices|price_cause topic.dir=up topic.cause=caravan|late|raid
weight 0.6
say It's the road. It's always the road. | Fix the roads and you'd fix the prices. | While the wagons are late, we pay.

rule s8o_view_prices_down
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=prices|price_cause topic.dir=down
weight 0.6
say It won't last. | Make the most of it, I say. | Somebody's selling at a loss.

rule s8o_view_times
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=times world.times=hard|lean
weight 0.6
say It'll turn. It always does. | It's the same everywhere, I hear. | We've come through worse.

rule s8o_view_harvest_poor
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=harvest|land world.harvest=poor
weight 0.6
say We'll feel it come winter. | Bread'll be dear by spring. | The fields want a better year.

rule s8o_view_harvest_good
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=harvest|land world.harvest=good
weight 0.6
tone light
say Good. Bread'll be cheaper. | A full barn makes a happy town. | We were due a good one.

rule s8o_view_festival
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=festival|event
weight 0.6
say A town needs its festivals. | We could all do with some fun. | Too much noise, if you ask me. | It brings folk together, at least.

rule s8o_view_weather
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=weather|season
weight 0.6
say Give me a cold clear day over this. | It's good for the fields, mind. | Every season has its trouble. | I'll take what comes.

rule s8o_view_work
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=work|day
weight 0.6
say Work's what keeps us honest. | Nobody's paid what they're worth. | An idle paw's worse than a sore one. | It's steady, and that's something.

rule s8o_view_food
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=food
weight 0.6
say Simple food's the best food. | Nothing beats bread still warm. | A good supper mends most things. | You can't work on an empty belly.

rule s8o_view_animals
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=animals|land
weight 0.6
say Beasts have more sense than folk. | The land doesn't lie. | You get out what you put in, with beasts.

rule s8o_view_faith
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=faith|dreams|lore
weight 0.6
say The gods help those who help themselves. | There's more in the old tales than folk think. | I keep my faith and my own counsel.

rule s8o_view_family
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=family|home
weight 0.6
say Blood's thicker than water. | A house is only as warm as the folk in it. | Family's a blessing and a burden, both.

rule s8o_view_travel
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=travel|accent|newcomer
weight 0.6
say Every road leads home in the end. | Travel broadens the mind and flattens the purse. | I'd see more of the realm, if I could.

rule s8o_view_player
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=player|deed
weight 0.6
say Travellers bring news and trouble, both. | Strangers come and go. The town stays. | They're welcome, so long as they pay.

rule s8o_view_sea
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=ships
weight 0.6
say The sea gives and takes. | Ships mean trade, and trade means bread. | I'd not go to sea for all the salt in Saltwell.

rule s8o_view_wagons
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=caravan
weight 0.6
say The wagons keep this town fed. | Late or not, we'd be lost without them. | Carters earn every penny.

rule s8o_view_road
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=bandits
weight 0.6
tone serious
say The roads want clearing, and soon. | Nobody's safe out there till it's done. | Somebody should send soldiers.

rule s8o_view_health
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=health
weight 0.6
say Rest cures most things. | You can't buy health. | A healer's worth every penny.

rule s8o_view_pastimes
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=pastimes|friends|smalltalk
weight 0.6
say Everyone needs something besides work. | Good company's worth more than coin. | It's the small things, in the end.

rule s8o_view_memories
does give.opinion
when conv.topic=memories
weight 0.6
say We remember the good and forget the rest. | The old days weren't so golden, really. | Things were simpler, once.

## agree: a view met with a nod, on the same everyday things (so a view is mostly agreed with)

rule s8o_agree_any
does agree
weight 1.5
say #agree#. | You're not wrong. | That's the truth. | I'd say the same. | Quite right. | Couldn't put it better.

rule s8o_agree_prices
does agree
when conv.topic=prices|price_cause|times
weight 1.5
say Dear as anything, aye. | You're telling me. My purse feels it. | It's a scandal, and that's the truth. | Every week, a penny more.

rule s8o_agree_weather
does agree
when conv.topic=weather|season
weight 1.5
say Isn't it just. | Aye, and no sign of it changing. | You're right there. | Couldn't agree more.

rule s8o_agree_work
does agree
when conv.topic=work|day
weight 1.5
say You're not wrong there. | Same in every trade. | Don't I know it. | Too true.

rule s8o_agree_food
does agree
when conv.topic=food
weight 1.5
say Now you're talking. | Can't beat it. | Aye, that's the way. | My belly agrees with you.

rule s8o_agree_news
does agree
when conv.topic=gossip|crime|news|life|newcomer|deed|player
weight 1.5
say So I'd think. | That's about the size of it. | Aye. That's how I see it. | You've the right of it.

rule s8o_agree_road
does agree
when conv.topic=bandits|caravan|travel|ships
weight 1.5
say Aye. Something has to give. | You're right. It can't go on. | That's the truth of it.

rule s8o_agree_home
does agree
when conv.topic=family|home|friends|pastimes|animals|land|health|faith|memories|dreams|lore|festival|event|harvest|smalltalk|accent
weight 1.5
say Aye, that's so. | You're right about that. | That's the way of it. | #bc_true_enough#

## give.advice by the trade of the one asking

rule s8o_advice_farm
does give.advice
when conv.topic=work|land|weather other.job=farmer|herder
say Get the hay in while it's dry. | Mend the fences before you need to. | Watch the sky and trust your nose.

rule s8o_advice_shop
does give.advice
when conv.topic=work|prices other.job=merchant|baker|brewer|innkeeper|cook
say Keep the shelves full and the prices fair. | Never give credit to a smiler. | Count the till twice.

rule s8o_advice_water
does give.advice
when conv.topic=work|weather other.job=fisher|sailor
say Don't go out if the sky's wrong. | Mend the nets on the quiet days. | Trust the old hands about the water.
